.TH OUTPOST 1
.SH NAME
outpost \- manage local multi-repository Git workspaces
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B outpost
command [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Outpost is operated by coding agents and developers. Workspace creation defaults to cached remote refs. Only explicit fresh-remote base selection fetches; dry runs never fetch.
